-- P79：同一窗口创建 OWNER 与 CHILD。isElementCreated 沿 owner 链应把 child 归入 created，
-- 只产生一个 new root；child 不重复记录 owner。目标为 run-owned SITE。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P AMS-R3-P79-APPLY-ALIVE
{{WORLD_ANCHOR}}
{{TARGET_NAME}}-Z
NEW EQUIPMENT {{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
POS E 41000 N 5000 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
NEW BOX XLEN 1000 YLEN 600 ZLEN 400
NAME {{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD
POS E 500 N 0 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
Q OWNE
{{TARGET_NAME}}-Z
Q MEMB
SAVEWORK 'AMS round3 P79 created ancestor dedupe'
$P AMS-R3-P79-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
